text_01E6:
    string "Don't boil me, mo!"           ; ja: 煮るなも！

text_01F1:
    string "No good, mo?"                 ; ja: だめだめも？

text_01FE:
    string "I can't breathe, mo... ≦"     ; ja: 息が出来ないも・・・≦

text_0215:
    string "That was really hard work, mo ★"  ; ja: ホント苦労したも★

text_0228:
    string "Now I can win, mo ♪"          ; ja: これで勝てるも♪

text_0239:
    string "It really got big, mo"        ; ja: ホントに大きくなったも

text_0250:
    string "Will my profits grow with this%Kbig store, mo?"  ; ja: このくらいで収入増えるのかも？

text_026F:
    string "I made it a little bigger, mo ♪"  ; ja: 少しおっきくしたも♪

text_0284:
    string "Just a warm-up, mo ♭"         ; ja: まだ、小手調べだも♭

text_0299:
    string "Too bad, mo ★"                ; ja: 残念だも★

text_02A4:
    string "May I go for a swim, mo?"     ; ja: 泳ぎに行っていいかも？

text_02BB:
    string "I want to relax once in a while,%Kmo"  ; ja: たまにはゆっくりしたいも

text_02D4:
    string "Hm? This is cheap, mo ♭"    ; ja: うん？これやす～いも♭

text_02EB:
    string "What's a bargain sale, mo?"   ; ja: バーゲンとはなんだも？

text_0302:
    string "For some reason I bought cheap%Ktoday, mo ♪"  ; ja: 今日は何故か安く買えたも♪

text_031D:
    string "I'll put water in the tub, mo"  ; ja: タライに水を入れとくも

text_0334:
    string "It's okay to take it easy today,%Kmo ♪"  ; ja: 今日くらい楽してもいいも♪

text_034F:
    string "It's %NMY's store, mo ♭"      ; ja: %NMYのお店だも♭

text_0360:
    string "I'm not in the mood to ride, mo..."  ; ja: 乗りたい気分じゃないも・・・

text_037D:
    string "It's not that I missed it, mo!"  ; ja: 乗り遅れた訳じゃないも！

text_0396:
    string "It's too hard, mooo... ≦≦"        ; ja: 苦しいもぉぉぉ・・・≦≦

text_03AF:
    string "Where shall I go next, mo ♪"  ; ja: 今度はどこに行こうかも♪

text_03C8:
    string "I got my pay, mo ♪"           ; ja: 給料を貰ったも♪

text_03D9:
    string "Now I can strike back, mo ∈"  ; ja: これで反撃できるも∈

text_03EE:
    string "A strange feeling, mo?"       ; ja: 変な感覚だも？

text_03FD:
    string "People are looking at me funny,%Kmo ∵"  ; ja: なんか変な目で見られてるも∵

text_041A:
    string "I've taken a liking to it, mo ♭"  ; ja: 気に入っちゃったも♭

text_042F:
    string "I'll think of some way to get%Keven, mo..."  ; ja: なんか仕返しを考えるも・・・

text_044C:
    string "Somehow I spent money, mo ≦"  ; ja: なんかお金使っちゃたもぉ≦

text_0467:
    string "Looks kind of risky, mo ∵∵"   ; ja: なんかヤバメだねも∵∵

text_047E:
    string "I got my money back, mo ♪"    ; ja: お金返してもらっちゃったも♪

text_049B:
    string "The surface world's system is%Kcomplicated, mo ♪"  ; ja: 地上のシステムは複雑だも♪

text_04B6:
    string "I came out ahead, but what now,%Kmo?"  ; ja: 得しちゃったけど、どうするも？

text_04D5:
    string "I messed up, mo"              ; ja: しっぱいしちゃったも

text_04EA:
    string "Woooo! Mo"                     ; ja: ウオ～∥！だも

text_04F9:
    string "Things are turning against me,%Kmo ∵∵"  ; ja: 状況は不利に展開してるも∵∵

text_0516:
    string "I've become the manager here,%Kmo ♪"  ; ja: ここの店長になっちゃったも♪

text_0533:
    string "A marimo is the manager, mo ♪"  ; ja: マリモが店長だも♪

text_0546:
    string "Anyway, I have to take one step%Kforward, mo ∵"  ; ja: とにかく一歩前進しなくちゃも∵

text_0565:
    string "Is my money going down fast, mo?"  ; ja: お金の減りがなんか早いも？

text_0580:
    string "Too many expenses lately, mo ∵"  ; ja: このごろ出費が多すぎだも∵

text_059B:
    string "I just can't save after all, mo"  ; ja: やっぱり節約って出来ないも

text_05B6:
    string "Maybe I'm about halfway?"     ; ja: 半分くらいに来たかも？

text_05CD:
    string "I can see my home lake, mo ♭"  ; ja: 故郷の湖が見えてきたも♭

text_05E6:
    string "Halfway at last, mo ★"        ; ja: ようやく半分だもぉ★

text_05FB:
    string "I'll send them water weeds to get%Keven, mo!"  ; ja: 仕返しに水草送ってやるも！

text_0616:
    string "Business is kind of tough, mo ∵"  ; ja: なんか経営が厳しいも∵

text_062D:
    string "I'll buy it back, so I'll hold on,%Kmo ≦≦"  ; ja: 買い戻すからガマンするも≦≦

text_064A:
    string "...It was only expensive, mo ≦"  ; ja: ・・・高かっただけも≦

text_0661:
    string "I don't need a store like this,%Kmo!"  ; ja: こんなお店はいらないも！

text_067A:
    string "Feels like a pinch, mo"       ; ja: なんかピンチって感じだもぉ

text_0695:
    string "I forgot to buy it, mo.... ∵"  ; ja: 買い忘れたも・・・・∵

text_06AC:
    string "The store doesn't suit my taste at%Kall, mo ≦"  ; ja: お店に感覚がまったくあわないも≦

text_06CD:
    string "I'll save money, mo ♪"        ; ja: お金を貯めるも♪

text_06DE:
    string "Puku-pukuuu"                 ; ja: ぷくぷくぅ～∥

text_06ED:
    string "Mo, momomo..."                ; ja: も、ももも・・・

text_06FE:
    string "Roll me up, please, mo!"      ; ja: まるめてぇちょうだいも！
    bytes 0x00    ; padding
